---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteIcon from '../components/SiteIcon.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="页面暂时不可访问｜老旧默片"
  description="当前页面不存在、地址已经改变，或相关档案暂时不对外开放。"
>
  <section class="not-found" aria-labelledby="not-found-title">
    <p class="not-found-mark icon-heading"><SiteIcon name="search" /><span>404 · PAGE UNAVAILABLE</span></p>
    <h1 id="not-found-title">这页目前找不到</h1>
    <p>
      地址可能已经改变，也可能对应一件目前不对外开放的档案。为了保护资料隐私，这里不会说明具体原因。
    </p>
    <div class="not-found-actions">
      <a class="ui-action ui-action--primary" href="/archive/">浏览现有档案</a>
      <a class="ui-action ui-action--secondary" href="/">返回首页</a>
    </div>
    <aside>
      <strong>如果你是在核对某件档案</strong>
      <span>请检查永久编号和页面地址；也可以查看纠错与撤下说明，准备需要提交的信息。</span>
      <a class="ui-text-link" href="/corrections/">查看纠错与撤下说明 →</a>
    </aside>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .not-found {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: start;
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(4.5rem, 10vw, 8rem) 0 clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  }

  .not-found-mark {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: var(--site-accent);
    font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
    font-size: var(--site-text-micro);
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 6vw, 3.7rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .not-found > p:not(.not-found-mark) {
    max-width: 38rem;
    margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
    color: #514e47;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 2;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  .not-found-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    margin-top: 1.6rem;
  }

  aside {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5rem);
    padding: 1.1rem;
    background: var(--site-paper);
    border: 1px solid #c8c0b1;
    border-left: 3px solid rgba(154, 63, 46, 0.42);
  }

  aside strong {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  aside span {
    color: var(--site-muted);
    font-size: var(--site-text-small);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  aside a {
    justify-self: start;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }
</style>
